<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 6705 0 R/Alt(Flow diagram. Pool A and pool B each pass from inbred lines (S1) through within-pool crosses and DH derivation (S2) and per-se line selection (S3) into a shared box of A x B crosses in trials, then to hybrid mining (S4), which outputs the commercial F1. Dashed arrows from the trial box return to each pool separately. Red triangles sit above S2, S3, S4 and the two recycling arrows.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[19]/Pg 99573 0 R>>
